<title>UK: Venantius sets 1.0 bln Lux franc five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Venantius sets 1.0 bln Lux franc five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENANTIUS AB (SWEDISH NATIONAL MORTGAGE AGENCY)</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     4.855     MATURITY    03.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
